seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# P8a: a harness answering a prose question within the settle: the asked
# turn closes at once, dated when the agent asked; the exchange is a turn of
# its own carrying by= and ledger=; an hour later the human's turn is the
# human's (P8b).
see busy
see question
pass 400
ctl
expect close t1 turn out=asked conf=heuristic @0
pass 200
see busy
expect open t1 turn
expect open t2 turn ledger=1 by=harness @600
see idle
half
half
expect close t2 turn out=done
pass 3600000
input human
see busy
expect open t3 turn by=human @3601600
